Full Frontal is a 2002 American comedy-drama film by Steven Soderbergh about
a day in the life of a handful of characters in Hollywood.

11
01:22:08,000 --> 01:22:14,000
It stars Catherine Keener, Blair Underwood, David Duchovny, Julia Roberts,
Mary McCormack, Nicky Katt, Brad Pitt, and David Hyde Pierce.

12
01:29:36,000 --> 01:29:42,000
The film was shot on digital video using the Canon XL-1s in under a month.

13
01:37:04,000 --> 01:37:10,000
The film blurs the line between what is real and what is fiction in its
depiction of a film within a film (and possibly within another).

14
01:44:32,000 --> 01:44:38,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
